        b2: "<b>What the curves & interactive handles mean:</b><ul><li><b>Solid glowing curve</b> — the total polynomial <b>y = P(x)</b> (dashed colored curves show individual monomial powers).</li><li><b>Green dots on the X-axis</b> — real roots where the curve pierces <b>y = 0</b>.</li><li><b>Yellow, cyan, and orange handles on the curve</b> — interactive handles you can <b>grab directly with your mouse or finger to bend the polynomial</b> in real time!</li></ul>",
